	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"&l·&fTired of writing endless boilerplate? Want to experience a new game, but have no way to start due to the large number of samples?"
				"&l·&fThis chapter provides an option:&6prefabricated template &f"
				"&l·&fAs the name suggests, you can place the packaged sample into the corresponding sample assembly with just a right click."
				"&l·&fThe premise is that you have the&bsuper model assembly"
				""
				"&l·&fIt is not recommended to rely entirely on prefabricated samples, as it will reduce your gaming experience, and prefabricated samples are not the optimal solution."
				""
				"&l·&5The current version is in the preliminary version. There may be unreasonable templates, missing templates, unreasonable template stages, etc., which will be fixed in subsequent versions."
				"&l·&5Please do not put unused prefabricated templates into AE. It will cause NBT to explode and greatly increase lag."
				""
				"&l·&7Source - GregTech Leisure - Private Edition"
			]
			icon: "gtlcore:me_pattern_buffer_cut"
